__d(function(g,r,i,a,m,e,d){"use strict";Object.defineProperty(e,'__esModule',{value:!0}),Object.defineProperty(e,"COURIER_DOCS_CARD",{enumerable:!0,get:function(){return t}}),Object.defineProperty(e,"COURIER_DOCS",{enumerable:!0,get:function(){return l}});const t={tr:{title:'\u26a0\ufe0f Belgeleri kontrol edin',body:'Bu kuryeyle \xe7al\u0131\u015fmadan \xf6nce ehliyetini, \xe7al\u0131\u015fma belgelerini ve izinlerini kontrol etti\u011finizden emin olun. Rota kurye belgelerini toplamaz ve do\u011frulamaz; kontrol sizin sorumlulu\u011funuzdad\u0131r.',more:'Hangi belgeler? Dokunun \u203a',onlyYou:'Bu notu yaln\u0131z siz g\xf6r\xfcrs\xfcn\xfcz.'},en:{title:'\u26a0\ufe0f Check the documents',body:"Before working with this courier, make sure you have checked their driving licence, work documents and permits. Rota does not collect or verify courier documents; checking them is your responsibility.",more:'Which documents? Tap \u203a',onlyYou:'Only you can see this note.'}},l={tr:{title:'Kuryenin \xe7al\u0131\u015fma belgeleri',sub:'Bilgi ama\xe7l\u0131d\u0131r \xb7 Ekim 2026',intro:'Kuryenin ta\u015f\u0131mas\u0131 gereken belgeler, \xe7al\u0131\u015fma \u015fekline (\u015firket kuryesi ya da kendi \u015fah\u0131s \u015firketiyle \xe7al\u0131\u015fan esnaf kurye) ve kulland\u0131\u011f\u0131 araca (motosiklet, otomobil, elektrikli bisiklet vb.) g\xf6re de\u011fi\u015fir.',sections:[{h:'1. Ehliyet (s\xfcr\xfcc\xfc belgesi)',p:'Kullan\u0131lan arac\u0131n s\u0131n\u0131f\u0131na uygun ehliyet zorunludur:',items:['M s\u0131n\u0131f\u0131: Moped (motorlu bisiklet). B s\u0131n\u0131f\u0131 ehliyetle de kullan\u0131labilir.','A1 s\u0131n\u0131f\u0131: 125 cc\u2019ye kadar motosikletler.','A2 s\u0131n\u0131f\u0131: 35 kW\u2019a (yakla\u015f\u0131k 47 beygir) kadar motosikletler; kuryelerin en \xe7ok tercih etti\u011fi s\u0131n\u0131f.','A s\u0131n\u0131f\u0131: G\xfc\xe7 s\u0131n\u0131r\u0131 olmadan t\xfcm motosikletler.','B s\u0131n\u0131f\u0131: Otomobille \xe7al\u0131\u015fan kuryeler.'],note:'Bisiklet ve pedal destekli elektrikli bisikletle (en \xe7ok 250 W, saatte en \xe7ok 25 km) \xe7al\u0131\u015fan kuryeden ehliyet istenmez. Bu s\u0131n\u0131rlar\u0131 a\u015fan elektrikli ara\xe7 moped say\u0131l\u0131r; ehliyet gerekir.'},{h:'2. Mesleki ve zorunlu belgeler',items:['SRC-Kurye Mesleki Yeterlilik Belgesi: Motosiklet ya da mopedle kurye ta\u015f\u0131yan s\xfcr\xfcc\xfc i\xe7in getirilen, kuryeye \xf6zel SRC belgesi. Otomobil ya da kamyonetle \xe7al\u0131\u015fan s\xfcr\xfcc\xfc i\xe7in hangi SRC belgesinin (\xf6r. SRC 4) gerekti\u011fini resm\xee kaynaktan kontrol edin.','Psikoteknik raporu: Ticari ara\xe7 kullanan s\xfcr\xfcc\xfcn\xfcn zihinsel ve fiziksel yeteneklerini \xf6l\xe7en rapor; 5 y\u0131lda bir yenilenir.','Kurye Faaliyet Belgesi: Kurye i\u015fletmecili\u011fi kurallar\u0131yla (May\u0131s 2025) gelen belge.','Sab\u0131ka kayd\u0131 (adli sicil kayd\u0131): Firmalar g\xfcvenilirlik i\xe7in ister; e-Devlet\u2019ten al\u0131n\u0131r.','\u0130kametg\xe2h belgesi: G\xfcncel yerle\u015fim yeri belgesi; e-Devlet\u2019ten al\u0131n\u0131r.'],note:'SRC-Kurye belgesi, sa\u011fl\u0131k ve psikoteknik raporu ile Kurye Faaliyet Belgesi 1 Ocak 2027\u2019den itibaren aran\u0131r (s\xfcre, 16 May\u0131s 2026 tarihli Resm\xee Gazete ile uzat\u0131ld\u0131).'},{h:'3. Esnaf kurye (kendi ad\u0131na \xe7al\u0131\u015fan) i\xe7in',p:'Esnaf kurye kendi \u015fah\u0131s \u015firketini kurar. Bu modelde \u015fu belgeler gerekir:',items:['Vergi levhas\u0131: \u015eah\u0131s \u015firketi a\xe7\u0131ld\u0131ktan sonra al\u0131n\u0131r.','\u0130mza beyannamesi: Noterden al\u0131n\u0131r; ki\u015finin ticari imzas\u0131n\u0131 g\xf6sterir.','Ba\u011f-Kur giri\u015f bildirgesi: Kendi sigortas\u0131n\u0131 \xf6dedi\u011fini g\xf6sterir.','Kurye i\u015fletmecisi yetki belgesi: Tek arac\u0131yla kendi ad\u0131na \xe7al\u0131\u015fan kurye de Ula\u015ft\u0131rma ve Altyap\u0131 Bakanl\u0131\u011f\u0131ndan al\u0131r.']},{h:'4. Ara\xe7 belgeleri',p:'Kurye kendi arac\u0131n\u0131 kullan\u0131yorsa bunlar eksiksiz olmal\u0131d\u0131r:',items:['Ara\xe7 ruhsat\u0131','Zorunlu mali mesuliyet sigortas\u0131 (trafik sigortas\u0131)','Ara\xe7 muayene raporu (T\xdcVT\xdcRK): Ticari ara\xe7ta muayene s\xfcresi ve s\u0131kl\u0131\u011f\u0131 farkl\u0131 olabilir.']}],tip:'Belgelerin asl\u0131n\u0131 g\xf6r\xfcn ya da barkodlu e-Devlet belgesini e-Devlet\u2019teki \u201cBarkodlu Belge Do\u011frulama\u201d ile kontrol edin.',disclaimer:'Bu liste bilgi ama\xe7l\u0131d\u0131r, hukuki g\xf6r\xfc\u015f de\u011fildir; kurallar de\u011fi\u015febilir. G\xfcncel \u015fartlar i\xe7in Ula\u015ft\u0131rma ve Altyap\u0131 Bakanl\u0131\u011f\u0131 duyurular\u0131na ve Resm\xee Gazete\u2019ye bak\u0131n. Rota bu belgeleri toplamaz ve do\u011frulamaz; kontrol i\u015fverenin sorumlulu\u011fundad\u0131r.',close:'Kapat'},en:{title:"Courier's work documents",sub:'For information \xb7 October 2026',intro:'The documents a courier needs depend on how they work (company courier, or self-employed courier with their own sole proprietorship) and on the vehicle (motorcycle, car, e-bike, etc.).',sections:[{h:'1. Driving licence',p:'A licence matching the vehicle class is required:',items:['Class M: Moped. Can also be ridden with a class B licence.','Class A1: Motorcycles up to 125 cc.','Class A2: Motorcycles up to 35 kW (about 47 hp); the class couriers choose most.','Class A: All motorcycles, no power limit.','Class B: Couriers working by car.'],note:'No licence is required for couriers on a bicycle or a pedal-assist e-bike (at most 250 W and 25 km/h). An electric vehicle above these limits counts as a moped and needs a licence.'},{h:'2. Professional and mandatory documents',items:['SRC-Courier Professional Competence Certificate (SRC-Kurye): the courier-specific SRC certificate for drivers carrying courier items by motorcycle or moped. For drivers working by car or van, check official sources for which SRC certificate (e.g. SRC 4) applies.','Psychotechnical report: Measures the mental and physical abilities of a commercial driver; renewed every 5 years.','Courier Activity Certificate (Kurye Faaliyet Belgesi): introduced with the courier business rules (May 2025).','Criminal record certificate: Companies ask for it for trust; available on e-Devlet.','Residence certificate: Current address document; available on e-Devlet.'],note:'The SRC-Courier certificate, the health and psychotechnical reports and the Courier Activity Certificate are required from 1 January 2027 (deadline extended in the Official Gazette of 16 May 2026).'},{h:'3. For self-employed couriers',p:'A self-employed courier sets up their own sole proprietorship. This model needs:',items:['Tax certificate (vergi levhas\u0131): Issued after the business is opened.','Signature declaration (imza beyannamesi): From a notary; shows the person\u2019s business signature.','Ba\u011f-Kur registration: Shows they pay their own social insurance.','Courier operator authorisation certificate: A courier working on their own account, even with a single vehicle, gets it from the Ministry of Transport and Infrastructure.']},{h:'4. Vehicle documents',p:'If the courier uses their own vehicle, these must be complete:',items:['Vehicle registration','Compulsory third-party liability insurance (traffic insurance)','Vehicle inspection report (T\xdcVT\xdcRK): Inspection period and frequency may differ for commercial vehicles.']}],tip:'See the originals, or check a barcoded e-Devlet document with the \u201cBarcoded Document Verification\u201d service on e-Devlet.',disclaimer:'This list is for information only and is not legal advice; the rules may change. For current requirements see the Ministry of Transport and Infrastructure announcements and the Official Gazette. Rota does not collect or verify these documents; checking them is the employer\u2019s responsibility.',close:'Close'}}},876,[]);
